Translating one metaphysics into another will generally yield problems. That
cannot be fixed by changing the language. I surmise that you would like just
one
metaphysics for the language, and you would like it to be much more
restricted
than the most permissive sort. The objections to that are that it is
metaphysically biased, that the metaphysics conflicts with the one that
others
might want, and that it is hard to implement as the basis of the semantics
of
default gadri.

